    "preamble": "Dara Sankara Rao vs State Of Ap on 30 July, 2019 Hon'Ble Sri Justice D.V.S.S. Somayajulu Crl.P.No. 4530 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "The offences alleged are under Sections 420, 272, 273, 188, 328 IPC and Sections 56, 57 (1) and 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners submits that in a similar case, this Court, by virtue of common order in Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and batch, [LEAKAGE_MASK] the proceedings against the petitioners therein by considering that transportation of Gutka is not attracted by the offences alleged under Sections 188, 270 and 273 of IPC and Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
